# ---- Gradle & build output --------------------------------------------------
.gradle
**/build/
# Kept: a source directory that happens to be called "build" is not output.
!src/**/build/
.kotlin
buildSrc/build/
*.hprof
**/.konan/
**/generated/
**/tmp/
**/kotlinProjectStructureMetadata/

